1. Purpose

This License governs the use of ADExMo, the Action-Driven Execution Model created and maintained by myobject srls.

ADExMo is made available as a free-to-use architectural and documentation model for designing, documenting, validating, and implementing application behavior through executable actions.

The purpose of this License is to allow broad adoption of ADExMo while preserving:

* the authorship of myobject srls;
* the integrity of the official ADExMo model;
* the correct attribution of ADExMo;
* the official meaning of the ADExMo name;
* protection against rebranding, misrepresentation, or false claims of ownership.

2. Definitions

For the purposes of this License:

"ADExMo" means the Action-Driven Execution Model, including its concepts, structure, terminology, documentation, ADRs, examples, guidance documents, templates, diagrams, and official specifications created or approved by myobject srls.

"Official ADExMo Materials" means any ADExMo documentation, specification, ADR, template, diagram, source document, example, or related material published or approved by myobject srls as part of the official ADExMo model.

"Implementation" means any software, documentation, workflow, internal process, adapter, runtime, library, tool, product, or project that applies or uses ADExMo without altering the Official ADExMo Materials or presenting itself as an official ADExMo version.

"Modified ADExMo Material" means any edited, extended, translated, renamed, reorganized, derived, or otherwise altered version of the Official ADExMo Materials.

"Official Approval" means prior written approval by myobject srls, including approval given by email, signed document, official repository record, issue comment, pull request approval, or another written channel controlled by myobject srls.

